{"translator":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）","rows":[{"id":"user-2","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……え？　『電話に出さない権』────\r\nそんなのもらってどうするんだ","trans":"……诶？　『不接电话权』────\n给我这种东西要我怎么用啊","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035770010","name":"透","text":"いいじゃん\r\n禁止、今は。出るの","trans":"有什么关系嘛\n现在禁止。接电话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-6","name":"プロデューサー","text":"いや、でも……仕事の電話とかはさ","trans":"不是，可是……工作上的电话总得接吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"4901035770020","name":"透","text":"勤務時間外じゃん","trans":"现在是工作时间外吧","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-9","name":"プロデューサー","text":"まぁ────","trans":"说的也是────","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-18","name":"プロデューサー","text":"……まぁ、うん","trans":"……嘛，嗯","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true},{"id":"user-22","name":"プロデューサー","text":"今は","trans":"现在的话","sourceId":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","exactOnly":true}],"additionalSources":[{"id":"user-enza-fix-2026-11-13","package":"enza-player-app-fix.zip","dictionary":"data/translations/zh_dynamic.json","sha256":"63c8feb976e689fa7d5b8d21e48ce143c9f462fdaa8a2d1c3367e9c7fccefd98","credit":"用户提供汉化包（原译者未注明）"}]}